<p>Thank you for your order!</p>

<p>We are currently reviewing the details and need a bit more information before we can begin production. Specifically, we need the&nbsp;<strong>bearing housing center dimensions</strong>&nbsp;to ensure proper assembly of the pulley.<br />
<br />
*BC pic will be here in Live*<br />
<br />
