<p>To keep your order on track, please provide the required dimensions at your earliest convenience so we can finalize the production print and move forward with manufacturing.</p>

<p>Thank you for your prompt attention to this matter.</p>

<p>Best regards,<br />
{{{Sender.Signature}}}</p>
